WEBVTT

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:47.620
<i>I was up late the night before the
world as I knew it came crashing down.</i>

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:23.320
<i>Yureta Genjitsukan Nakushita mama de</i>

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:23.320
<i>As I lose my already shaken touch with reality,</i>

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:28.370
<i>Gareki no Youni Tsumikasanaru</i>

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:28.370
<i>my emotions pile up like fallen debris</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>Kono Kanshou wa Doko e Yuku</i>

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>Where do they think they're going?</i>

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.920
<i>Tsuieta Kibou Kakae</i>

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.920
<i>With my crushed hope in tow,</i>

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:42.880
<i>Akai Ame o Harai Hashitta Muchuu ni</i>

00:01:35.220 --> 00:01:42.880
<i>I ran straight through the bloody rain</i>

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:49.540
<i>Kuzureta Kanjou no Hate ni</i>

00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:49.540
<i>After my emotions come spilling out,</i>

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:50.840
<i>Nani o Miru</i>

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:50.840
<i>what will I see?</i>

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:52.110
<i>Nani ga Aru</i>

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:52.110
<i>What will I have?</i>

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.790
<i>Mada Shiranai</i>

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.790
<i>I still don't know</i>

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:59.670
<i>Hakanai Subete no Minori wa</i>

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:59.670
<i>But in this silence,</i>

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.240
<i>Tada Muon ni Me no Mae ni</i>

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.240
<i>all of the shallow things I could gain</i>

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:09.250
<i>Hirogari Tsudzuketa</i>

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:09.250
<i>lie endlessly before me</i>

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.480
Are you stupid?

00:02:28.760 --> 00:02:29.940
Takagi...

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:32.950
You always run off to the same spot whenever you have a problem.

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:34.690
It's like you're a little kid.

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:34.570
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:37.390
<i>Until then, everything had been normal.</i>

00:02:35.050 --> 00:02:38.550
It's only the beginning of the semester.

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.550
<i>There I was out in the sunshine</i>

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:44.470
<i>having a great time telling myself that out of all of the 2nd year students in the world,</i>

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.600
<i>I was the 4th most miserable one.</i>

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:51.880
<i>But at that time, everything...</i>

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:55.630
<i>...was more or less over.</i>

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.640
Woah, Mr. Tejima!

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.790
Don't resort to violence...

00:03:26.740 --> 00:03:28.500
<i>Looking back on it,</i>

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:32.540
<i>we should've just made our way outside.</i>

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:36.550
<i>Instead, we scrambled to the observatory.</i>

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:40.550
<i>Back then, it seemed like the best thing to do.</i>

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:41.570
Re--

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:42.450
Rei!

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:50.090
Why...

00:03:50.510 --> 00:03:52.450
Why is this happening?

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:54.930
There must be a reason.

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:58.790
If we knew the reason, we could figure out what to do.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:14.420
<i>Hisashi is always right.</i>

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:17.070
<i>I wanted to believe that too.</i>

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:26.120
<i>But I had this gut feeling that our world had already fallen apart.</i>

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.240
<i>So...</i>

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:30.520
<i>I...</i>

00:04:38.700 --> 00:04:39.500
Gotcha!

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:40.530
Eat this!

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.070
<i>Yeah...</i>

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:49.000
<i>During that time,</i>

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:52.350
<i>it was too risky for us to think
that the world was still normal.</i>

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:52.350
Go away!

00:04:52.920 --> 00:04:54.480
<i>Then it hit me.</i>

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:59.700
<i>We were walking through our school hallway carrying weapons and expecting to face danger.</i>

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:01.320
<i>It wasn't a hallway anymore.</i>

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:04.570
I'm sick of these things! I want my mom!

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.690
<i>Yeah... This is...</i>

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:07.820
<i>...the country of the dead.</i>

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:19.160
Do you think someone will come and help us?

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:20.510
No.

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.170
But why?

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:24.200
How can you say that?

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:27.220
Remember the helicopters we saw from the school rooftop this afternoon? It's the same deal.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:30.220
No one can be bothered to help us.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:33.110
In fact, we might never...

00:05:33.110 --> 00:05:34.150
Never?

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.230
We might never get any help?

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:38.800
Then how are we going to make it through this?!

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:42.940
We just have to do what we can. That's just the situation we're in.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.280
You're always like this...

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.200
You always say the wrong thing at the wrong time.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.810
You've been like this since kindergarten...

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.650
I was just stating the truth!

00:05:53.650 --> 00:05:56.800
So?! You could say it different--

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:05.540
We should go.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.310
Yeah...

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:19.560
Should we act only in our own
self-interest, we stand not a chance.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.510
Let us act as a team.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.500
Let's go!

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.790
<i>Our actions at the time meant</i>

00:06:33.790 --> 00:06:40.360
<i>that we were ready to take on the real problem and fight these animated pieces of flesh.</i>

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:48.430
<i>We ran through our school that was filled with noises, screams, life and death.</i>

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.940
They're not humans.

00:06:53.490 --> 00:06:56.250
They're not humans anymore!

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.990
It's dangerous outside!

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:21.540
Don't get out of your car under any circumstances!

00:07:22.280 --> 00:07:23.460
I repeat!

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:26.450
Don't get out of your car under any circumstances!

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:31.110
We progress at roughly one kilometer an hour.

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:35.350
I wonder if we can even make it over the bridge before morning at this rate?

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.860
Oh shut up! Put a lid on it!

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:44.250
Put a lid on it? But... I'm hungry...

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:54.100
There there.

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.940
We're safe in here.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.520
We'll be okay.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:01.230
Teacher...

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.150
There's nothing to worry about.

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:07.590
We'll be oka~ay.

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.720
Well that's that.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:18.980
I've become the leader based on a majority vote.

00:08:25.460 --> 00:08:26.520
Rei!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:28.780
Screw it!

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:31.470
No way in hell am I going to be anywhere near him!

00:08:33.260 --> 00:08:34.220
Wait!

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:37.160
You just have to put up with him until we get to the city.

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:39.310
Didn't I tell you that you'd regret this?!

00:08:39.580 --> 00:08:41.200
Look, now's not...

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:44.940
Dr. Marikawa!

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:51.840
<i>In other words, I didn't know yet</i>

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.810
<i>that this world had already ended.</i>

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:00.790
Komuro! Are the two of you unharmed?

00:09:10.910 --> 00:09:11.940
The police station!

00:09:12.300 --> 00:09:14.610
We'll meet at the East Police Station.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.840
At what time?

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.470
7 PM!

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:22.340
If it doesn't work out today,
then we'll try again tomorrow!

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:53.090
There's... no one here.

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:55.660
Either they ran away, or they died.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.700
If they died, they'd be walking around!

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:02.560
Then they went to chase after... living people...

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:11.020
Look, Takashi!

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:17.760
License? Nope. Helmets? Nope. Bike? Stolen.

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:20.030
He's gonna arrest us.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:24.840
Don't tell me you're afraid of a police car after beating up so many of them.

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:25.940
Of course I'm not.

00:11:36.090 --> 00:11:37.430
Are you serious?

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.080
Rei!

00:11:40.700 --> 00:11:42.660
There's gas leaking from the car.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:43.640
Don't get close!

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.640
We might find something useful.

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:49.710
What are you staring at?

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:50.880
You should help too!

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.850
Do you know how to use a gun?

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.100
I've seen some cop shows.

00:12:12.480 --> 00:12:16.820
You only put your finger on the trigger when you want to shoot, right?

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:26.290
Is something wrong?

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.550
It... feels kinda heavy.

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:32.210
Well duh. It's not a toy.

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.800
I only have five shots?

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:44.270
Here, Takashi.

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:52.070
It's from the other officer.

00:12:52.070 --> 00:12:54.630
His gun wasn't in working condition,

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:56.940
but you can still use the bullets.

00:12:56.940 --> 00:12:59.210
Wow, I'm amazed.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.850
I've seen the one my dad uses.

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:07.390
And do you think I'd be afraid of blood after what we've gone through?

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.880
Wanna throw these away?

00:13:18.880 --> 00:13:21.320
Guns aren't exactly reliable if you don't know how to aim.

00:13:21.320 --> 00:13:25.640
But you feel a bit safer now, don't you?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:45.160
Self-Serve

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:45.160
Self-Serve

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:48.840
I wonder if they still have some gas.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:53.800
Every gas station has at least
enough gas to fill up 1,000 cars.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:54.960
I'm sure they do.

00:13:58.580 --> 00:13:59.550
Shit.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:01.900
What is it?

00:14:02.130 --> 00:14:04.800
This is a self-serve station.

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:07.110
We need to slide a card or put in some cash.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:08.700
Then do it.

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:13.580
I bought a juice earlier... I only have 30 yen left.

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:16.110
You suck.

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.860
Well excuse me for not being Hisashi!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.180
What the hell's your problem?

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:26.470
When did I ever compare you with Hisashi?

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.220
You told me that I suck.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.630
That would mean there's someone awesome to compare me against!

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:32.330
You're obviously thinking of Hisashi!

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.880
You suck so much.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:41.340
What do you want?

00:14:41.850 --> 00:14:43.970
Cash! Can I borrow some?

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:48.490
Well, my purse is back in my bag.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:54.120
What, and you just told me that I suck?

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.430
Wait right here.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:58.080
Just scream if something happens.

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.350
Is... anyone here?

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:28.360
Like that would open it...

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:32.790
Well, I've always wanted to try this.

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:40.960
What was that?

00:15:45.180 --> 00:15:47.280
Wow, sounds like someone's having fun...

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:58.830
I should probably quit giving him a hard time...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:09.720
Rei?

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:13.300
Hey! Stop moving!

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:17.570
Rei, what's wrong?

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:29.200
Hey bro! Your girl is pretty cute!

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:30.620
Let her go!

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:33.900
You dumb? Like hell I'd do that.

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:39.790
If I want to survive in this monster filled world, I need a woman.

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:45.730
Are you... insane?

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.740
Am I insane?

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:49.370
Damn right I am!

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:53.460
My family all turned into those things right in front of me!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.380
I...

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:58.870
I had to smash every single one of their heads!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:02.860
My father, my mother, my grandmother, my little brother...

00:17:03.130 --> 00:17:05.360
Even my sister who's still in grade school!

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:08.360
How the fuck could I stay sane?

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.320
Takashi!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:17.720
Rei!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:21.370
Her tits and her voice are mighty fine!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:25.590
And these are p-pretty big.

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:27.760
Hey...

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:29.580
You fuck her, right?

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:31.850
Every night, don't you?

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:34.810
Or... wait...

00:17:34.810 --> 00:17:36.440
You don't?

00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:38.930
Are you an idiot?!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.040
Takashi!

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:49.080
Hey, toss me that bat!

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:51.670
If you don't, she's dead.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.060
And...

00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.700
I'm taking your bike.

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.260
It's out of gas.

00:17:57.260 --> 00:17:59.150
You busted the cash register!

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:01.430
You've got tons of money!

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.460
Refill the damn thing!

00:18:20.380 --> 00:18:26.020
Please place your hand on a
resistive seat before you begin.

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:29.260
Hey...

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:30.960
Can you let us go?

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:36.130
We're on our way to see if our parents are safe.

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:39.800
Weren't you listening to a thing I said?!

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:44.000
If they're in town, then your
parents met the same fate as mine!

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:46.480
Done.

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.700
Then go!

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:50.760
Just go!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.420
Hey, can you—

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:02.310
Shut up! Do you want me to kill you too?!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:10.400
Hey, please—

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:11.210
Shut up!

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:13.700
Or I'll seriously fucking kill you!

00:19:25.080 --> 00:19:26.580
I've never fired a gun before,

00:19:27.550 --> 00:19:29.350
but I can't miss at point-blank range.

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.590
Wh-What if it ignites the gasoline?

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:36.320
It's a lot better than giving you my girl.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.620
FUCK!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:56.930
Bl-Blood... BLOOD!

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:03.020
How... dare you...

00:20:03.020 --> 00:20:04.520
Don't do it, Rei.

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.050
But!

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:09.770
We don't have time to deal with him.

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:11.170
After all...

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:14.490
That noise we made was loud.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:23.410
Hey!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.180
You're just gonna leave?

00:20:25.180 --> 00:20:26.950
You're gonna leave me here?

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:28.990
Come on! Help me!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.810
Please, help me!

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.000
Hey!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:36.060
Hey...

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:07.560
Kuyami ga Owaru to

00:21:03.750 --> 00:21:07.560
Once the sorrow dissipates,

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:14.100
Kuraku Yodomu Ki no Me ga Tsubuyaku

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:14.100
buds sprout out of the darkness and begin to grow

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:18.170
Tada Kuzureta Sekai

00:21:14.100 --> 00:21:18.170
I'm in a world that has fallen to ruins

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:26.620
Ashita e no Ikiba Sura Nakushita Kedo

00:21:18.170 --> 00:21:26.620
I had lost my way toward tomorrow,

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:31.930
Mamorubeki Hito Koe ga Michibiku

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:31.930
but the voice of the one I must protect guides me

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:38.830
Namida o Mou Minai to Kimeta Toki

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:38.830
When I swore to never see her cry again,

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.970
Kokoro no Kase Kowashite

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:42.970
I freed my heart of its shackles

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:47.880
Ima Todaeru Kodou o

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:47.880
and grasped a burning blade

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:55.000
Honoo e Tokasu Ha o Nigirishime

00:21:47.880 --> 00:21:55.000
A blade that would melt my heart into fire

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:59.890
Ima Fureru Yubi o

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:59.890
As my fingers tremble,

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:06.600
Hikigane no Kuro ni Tsuyoku Ategau

00:21:59.890 --> 00:22:06.600
I firmly place them on my heavy, black trigger

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:19.420
Kono Inochi o Tada  Kuuki no Tama ni Kaete

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:19.420
and turn my life into a shot of air

00:22:33.400 --> 00:22:35.290
Is something wrong, Takashi?

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:36.570
You haven't said anything.

00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:42.590
As we keep moving, we'll probably see that same thing happen over and over.

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:44.460
Really?

00:22:45.180 --> 00:22:47.800
Yeah... You're right.

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:52.020
Forget about it.

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:53.040
Let's hurry.

00:22:57.390 --> 00:22:59.750
<i>Of course, I never forgot about it.</i>

00:23:00.680 --> 00:23:03.630
<i>The first day after the world came to an end,</i>

00:23:03.630 --> 00:23:07.730
<i>I was responsible for someone's death.</i>

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:11.970
<i>I couldn't possibly forget that.</i>

00:23:26.610 --> 00:23:27.570
Crazy.

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:29.920
This is worse than a war...

